cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SAES in scientific publications or empirical algorithm benchmarks, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SAES: Stochastic Algorithm Evaluation Suite"
abstract: >-
  Open-source scientific Python library for rigorous frequentist, exact Bayesian,
  equivalence (TOST), sensitivity (MDES), and Dolan-More meta-benchmarking
  statistical evaluation of stochastic optimization algorithms and machine learning models.
authors:
  - family-names: Carreira
    given-names: Emilio R.
  - family-names: Nebro
    given-names: Antonio J.
repository-code: "https://github.com/saes-suite/saes"
url: "https://saes-suite.github.io/saes/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - statistics
  - benchmarking
  - metaheuristics
  - hypothesis-testing
  - bayesian-statistics
  - nonparametric
  - critical-distance
  - performance-profiles
  - equivalence-testing
  - reproducibility
